=== M3. ROW CORRESPONDENCE WITHOUT A KEY: colour refinement + individualization, from group-by and re-index ===
H = G with node rows and edge rows randomly permuted (unless stated).  classes1 / unique1 / rnd1 = colour classes, nodes with a
unique colour, and rounds after the FIRST refinement; indiv = individualizations tried; backtr = those undone; rounds = all refinement rounds.

